sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Operator
    participant S as run_processing.sh
    participant P as Python helpers
    participant SS as spark-submit
    participant Y as YARN
    O->>S: run stage with flags
    S->>P: load .env defaults
    S->>P: resolve settings
    P-->>S: executors, memory, dry-run
    Note over S: package code and venv
    S->>SS: submit in client mode
    SS->>Y: request executors
    Y-->>SS: executors started
